<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Friday's close, USDA said. Trade slow. Demand and seller interest light.</p>
<p>Carcass Basis Steers and heifers not well tested. Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1200-1300 lbs few 113.00. Reported sales for Mon - 300   Week to Date - 1,500.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
